# Rust build output
/target
# adit-rdp is a separate (nested) workspace with its own target dir.
crates/adit-rdp/target/
# So is each vendored crate: they carry a `[workspace]` table so their own tests
# can be run in place, which gives each one a target dir that the root `/target`
# rule (anchored at the repo root) does not cover.
crates/adit-rdp/vendor/*/target/

# Session logs
logs
*.log

